:"LA_kwDOCCum187fhsU3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/labels/scope:%20reactivityTransform","name":"scope: reactivityTransform","color":"F005E6","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2022-07-19T23:56:38Z","updated_at":"2023-09-15T00:18:31Z","closed_at":"2023-01-26T08:26:18Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Vue version\r\n\r\nv3.2.37\r\n\r\n### Link to minimal reproduction\r\n\r\nhttps://sfc.vuejs.org/#eNo9TjsOwjAMvUpkdQAJErFWoRIbh8hSKpe2aj6yXRiq3p2kICb7ffz8VrilpF8LQg2WOxqTKEZZUuOCC10MLIrUVVWE/eFydKGqDpSHNV/zbrOCPs2tYEZK2eHS3HGeozV5K9a/DCcYfYokZ98mPXEM+e1ajtxPYAe12pnC5V4FOxhEEtfGcN+VshPrSE+TN01LkNGjRvbnB8U3I+VgByVic2GD7QP4UU0C\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\nOpen the reproduction link, there's an error on SFC playground. `Cannot access 'r' before initialization`\r\n\r\nThe code\r\n```ts\r\nconst r = $ref(1)\r\n$$(r)\r\n```\r\nis transformed to \r\n```js\r\nconst r = _ref(1)\r\n(r)\r\n```\r\n\r\nWe can see that `$$` is removed, and only brackets remain. It will break the original semantics.\r\nIt's actually only one line code: `const r = _ref(1)(r)`.\r\n\r\n### What is expected?\r\n\r\n```js\r\nconst r = _ref(1)\r\nr\r\n\r\n// ⬇️ formatted to\r\nconst r = _ref(1);\r\nr;\r\n```\r\n\r\n### What is actually happening?\r\n\r\n```js\r\nconst r = _ref(1)\r\n(r)\r\n\r\n// ⬇️ formatted to\r\nconst r = _ref(1)(r);\r\n```\r\n\r\n### System Info\r\n\r\n```shell\r\nN/A\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n### Any additional comments?\r\n\r\nIMHO, the brackets should be removed to avoid changing the semantics when using `$$` function.","closed_by":{"login":"sxzz","id":6481596,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0ODE1OTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6481596?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sxzz","html_url":"https://github.com/sxzz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sxzz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sxzz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sxzz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sxzz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sxzz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sxzz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sxzz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sxzz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sxzz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/6312/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/6312/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}